Backport of JDK-8229258: Rewrite markOop as a concrete value type (markWord).
Fixes Clang 13+ "this" alignment assumptions that crash Hotspot on JDK 11-13.
Source: https://github.com/openjdk/jdk11u-dev/pull/1284
Stripped: .github/workflows and LogCompilation target .class files.

